WEBVTT

0
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.916
Faseeh: gyara karatunka cikin minti ɗaya.

1
00:00:04.016 --> 00:00:07.582
Zaɓi surar da kake son karantawa.

2
00:00:07.682 --> 00:00:11.169
Karanta daga farkon sura har inda kake so: Faseeh zai gane da kansa inda ka tsaya.

3
00:00:11.269 --> 00:00:13.952
Idan kana son farawa daga wata aya, matsa ta.

4
00:00:14.052 --> 00:00:17.852
Danna “Saurari mai karatu” don jin ayoyin da muryar Shaikh Muhammad Siddiq al-Minshawi.

5
00:00:17.952 --> 00:00:21.726
Ana haskaka kalmar da ake karantawa yayin da kake saurare.

6
00:00:21.826 --> 00:00:25.364
Ba za ka iya yin rikodi yanzu ba? Loda fayil da aka riga aka nada da “Loda rikodina”.

7
00:00:25.464 --> 00:00:31.200
Danna “Fara rikodi”, ka karanta da murya bayyananniya, sannan ka dakatar da rikodin.

8
00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.784
Faseeh yana nazarin karatunka cikin ’yan daƙiƙoƙi.

9
00:00:33.884 --> 00:00:39.150
Za ka ga kashi na kalmomin da suka dace da ayoyin da ka karanta; kalmar da ke da kuskure za ta yi haske.

10
00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:47.369
Danna kalmar don ganin yadda ake furta ta daidai a rubuce, da makhrajin harafin a hoto.

11
00:00:47.469 --> 00:00:50.947
Ana kuma nuna ƙa'idar tajwidi da ta shafi kuskuren.

12
00:00:51.047 --> 00:00:57.647
Saurare ta da muryar makaranci: kalmar kaɗai, ko ayar gaba ɗaya.

13
00:00:57.747 --> 00:01:01.670
“Kunna rikodina” yana sake kunna karatunka don ka kwatanta.

14
00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:07.207
A “Furucin kalma” za ka koyi furta kowace kalma ba tare da rikodi ba.

15
00:01:07.307 --> 00:01:12.035
Ana samun Faseeh a cikin harsuna goma sha uku.

16
00:01:12.335 --> 00:01:15.438
Faseeh samfurin basirar wucin gadi ne da zai iya kuskure; ba ya maye gurbin gogaggen malami.
